<view class="container nav-safe overview-page"><view class="eyebrow">FORECAST WINDOW · 01 HOUR</view><view class="title page-title">一小时影响预测</view><view class="subtitle">按时间推进查看各区域进入强回波影响范围的可能性。</view><view class="card forecast-card"><view class="row"><view><view class="caption">{{selectedLead}} 分钟后</view><view class="forecast-number">{{selectedLead >= 60 ? 83 : selectedLead >= 30 ? 68 : 55}}<text>%</text></view><view class="forecast-label">最大区域超阈值概率</view></view><text class="tag tag-red">重点关注</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{selectedLead >= 60 ? 83 : selectedLead >= 30 ? 68 : 55}}%"></view></view><view class="row progress-label"><text>当前 12:10</text><text>预计 13:10</text></view></view><view class="section-title section-gap">时间轴</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="lead-scroll" show-scrollbar="false"><view class="lead-list"><block wx:for="{{leads}}" wx:key="min"><view class="lead-pill {{selectedLead === item.min ? 'active' : ''}}" data-min="{{item.min}}" bindtap="chooseLead"><text>+{{item.min}}</text><text class="lead-prob">{{item.probability}}%</text></view></block></view></scroll-view><view class="section-title section-gap row"><text>区域风险排序</text><text class="section-note">按概率降序</text></view><view class="rank-list"><block wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id"><view class="rank-row card"><view class="rank-num">{{index + 1}}</view><view class="rank-copy"><view class="row"><text class="rank-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="rank-prob">{{item.probability}}%</text></view><view class="rank-track"><view class="rank-fill {{item.color}}" style="width: {{item.probability}}%"></view></view><text class="rank-reason">{{item.time}} · {{item.reason}}</text></view></view></block></view><view class="section-title section-gap">判断依据</view><view class="basis-grid"><block wx:for="{{basis}}" wx:key="title"><view class="card basis-card"><view class="basis-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><text class="basis-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="basis-value">{{item.value}}</text><text class="basis-detail">{{item.detail}}</text></view></block></view><button class="primary-btn evidence-btn" bindtap="goEvidence">查看完整判断依据</button></view>
